\end{gathered}

Comparing$ the $coefficients of \hat{$\mathbf{i}$}, \hat{\mathfrak{j}}$ and $\hat{$\mathbf{k}$}$, we get

\begin{aligned}& x-2=8, y-10=-2, z-1=1 \\
\Rightarrow & x=10, y=8, z=2
\end{aligned}

\therefore$ Final co-ordinate $=(10,8,2)$

